      "side": 1,
      "message": "TBH, I don\u0027t know what this does (or how LocalePicker works).\n\nWhat\u0027s the relationship between LocalePicker.updateLocale() and mPhone.mContext.getResources().getConfiguration().getLocales()?\n\nWhat\u0027s the chance of getting an odd combination like {\"de\", \"US\"} (i.e. US German), and what would LocalePicker do in that case?",
