      "writtenOn": "2020-02-11T15:56:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e What\u0027s the relationship between LocalePicker.updateLocale() and \n\u003e mPhone.mContext.getResources().getConfiguration().getLocales()?\n\nThis is supposed to return the list of Locales available with the top locale first but actually in my tests the list is only one item, the top locale en_US.\n\nLocalePicker.updateLocale() updates the visible item seen in SUW and the locale used by the system. This does not mean that the user cannot update it once more in SUW.\n\n\u003e What\u0027s the chance of getting an odd combination like {\"de\", \"US\"} (i.e. US German), and \n\u003e what would LocalePicker do in that case?\n\nAt the moment I would say zero chance since I believe this method always reports en_US if there is no sim card.",
      "parentUuid": "b6c4e3ca_2cd302fe",
